[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5983712609","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124081#issuecomment-5983712609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124081","id":5983712609,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZKg1YQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-04T19:44:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T19:44:42Z","body":"How does this fix even work?\r\n\r\nI looked at the inspector's code. Setting any property will call `update_tree()` immediately. In case of the linked MRP, switching between nodes causes 35 (!) inspector updates. This is a very expensive operation, so no wonder it's so slow.\r\n\r\nI tried replacing all `update_tree()` calls with `update_tree_pending`, but the result is questionable (it's fast though).\r\n\r\n[Nagranie ekranu_20261004_213926.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9be7b31d-8a63-436d-a8ac-8f2ae7b56620)\r\n\r\nMaybe what could work is a deferred unique update, similar to `queue_redraw()` etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5983712609/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5984013915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124081#issuecomment-5984013915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124081","id":5984013915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZKzOWw","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-04T20:20:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T20:20:48Z","body":"> How does this fix even work?\r\n\r\nBy setting the color level _before_ the inspector edits the object so the tree update happens faster, because there's nothing in it.\r\n\r\n> Maybe what could work is a deferred unique update, similar to _queue_redraw()_ etc.\r\n\r\nI agree, but this is beyond the scope of this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5984013915/reactions",